  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for the Governance &amp; Institutions Umbrella Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The World Bank Group supports sustainable solutions that reduce poverty and build shared prosperity in developing countries by financing investment, mobilizing capital in international financial markets, and providing advisory services and analytical work. Governance &amp; Institutions Umbrella Program is designed to improve public sector performance and institutional reform, increase the application of digital and technology solutions, and enhance transparency and accountability by increasing government openness to citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
